確に謳っている以上、そういう機能は需要がないとして実装しないんでしょうけど。","ts":"1628038098.300500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g0bI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be9bc405-107a-44ec-8569-f7e40ffd1c1c","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"現実解としてそれが一番理想なのですが実際はそうなってないんですよね…それこそサイレント（参加はするけど全ての通知などは無視される）みたいな機能があればいいのですが。","ts":"1628037798.299800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5=kAA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2b4562ba-1736-4a01-870d-86ec7f490dae","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ミュートしたチャンネルは見ていなくても全部見たことにして既読状態になってほしい。気になってしまう時点でミュートになってないんだよな","ts":"1628037476.298000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":7,"users":["U022J6JLQ3V","U022XK5866Q","U022PB40WAF","UBQ2H65JQ","U81LLJ340","U013QL1RAPN","U01D9BALEKU"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s3J5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4c019890-4b16-454f-ae5e-5341699fc91f","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"仕様的には至極当然なんだけど…。","ts":"1628030064.296800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OwU0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a2eccaae-acfa-4e87-aa57-83e2ff80c6b9","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"all unreads全然使ってないな...","ts":"1628030053.296600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hca"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e55c2b1-961d-46d1-a81e-45833d0233e6","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"Slackってチャンネルをミュートしていても「全未読」にきっちり積まれてしまうので飯テロに弱すぎる。そのせいでいちいちチャンネル退出する羽目になる。","ts":"1628029975.295000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/w9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0859fe89-3826-4005-aaa3-1ec84a733362","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim/vim/commit/b9115da4bec5e6cfff69da85cc47c42dd6